.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
A collection of candidates, returned by `PackageFinder\&.find_best_candidate`\&.

This class is only intended to be instantiated by CandidateEvaluator's
`compute_best_candidate()` method\&.

.fi
.PP
 
